<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Kiez Living · Shop Assistant</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/chat.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
    <header class="topbar">
        <div class="brand">
            <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">K</span>
            <div>
                <div class="brand-name">Kiez Living</div>
                <div class="brand-sub">Shop assistant · Symfony + Neuron AI</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="topbar-actions">
            <span class="model-badge" title="Configured in .env / .env.local">{{ model }}</span>
            <button type="button" class="btn-ghost" id="new-chat">New chat</button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="layout">
        <section class="chat" aria-label="Chat">
            <div class="messages" id="messages" aria-live="polite">
                <div class="welcome" id="welcome">
                    <h1>Hi! How can I help?</h1>
                    <p>I can check your orders and search our products. Ask in English or German.</p>
                    <div class="suggestions" id="suggestions">
                        <button type="button" class="chip">Where is my order SO-1002?</button>
                        <button type="button" class="chip">Wo ist meine Bestellung SO-1003?</button>
                        <button type="button" class="chip">Which lamps are in stock?</button>
                        <button type="button" class="chip">Show orders for lena.fischer@example.com</button>
                        <button type="button" class="chip">Gifts under 30 €?</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <form class="composer" id="composer" autocomplete="off">
                <label for="input" class="visually-hidden">Your message</label>
                <textarea id="input" rows="1" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Ask about an order or a product…" required></textarea>
                <button type="submit" class="btn-send" id="send" aria-label="Send">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12l16-8-6 16-2.5-6.5L4 12z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
                </button>
            </form>
        </section>

        <aside class="panel" aria-label="Database">
            <div class="panel-head">
                <h2>Orders in the database</h2>
                <button type="button" class="btn-link" id="refresh-orders">Refresh</button>
            </div>
            <p class="panel-hint">Live from the <code>orders</code> table. Click an order to ask about it.</p>
            <ul class="orders" id="orders">
                <li class="orders-empty">Loading…</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="panel-foot">
                <strong>How it works:</strong> the agent decides which tool to call
                (<code>find_order</code>, <code>list_customer_orders</code>, <code>search_products</code>),
                the tool runs a SQL query, and the model answers with the real data.
            </div>
        </aside>
    </main>
</div>

<script src="/js/chat.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
